    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb5My style is ridiculous\ud83c\udfb5</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298660/extras/ef5713be59ebc2f947079fbcc5201bd2.poster.avif?t=1736218150\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298660/extras/ef5713be59ebc2f947079fbcc5201bd2.webm?t=1736218150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298660/extras/ef5713be59ebc2f947079fbcc5201bd2.mp4?t=1736218150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toilet World is a short horror game themed around Skibidi Toilet, a popular series of humorous and absurd animated short films on YouTube, known for its humorous and absurd style, as well as its catchy music that has garnered many fans. This time, let's experience the fun of entering the world of Skibidi Toilet ourselves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb5Brrr, skibidi, dom-dom-dom, yes-yes Skibidi-dabudu, nib-nib\ud83c\udfb5</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298660/extras/d9d76ad21e4b2a9449009637e9f7442f.poster.avif?t=1736218150\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298660/extras/d9d76ad21e4b2a9449009637e9f7442f.webm?t=1736218150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298660/extras/d9d76ad21e4b2a9449009637e9f7442f.mp4?t=1736218150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Explore Unique Toilet Worlds:</i></strong> There's treasure hidden in the toilets! Each room presents a new, whimsical world with distinct themes and surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Music and Sound:</i></strong> Enjoy the iconic Skibidi music and sound effects that add to the game's charm and hilarity. The audio experience will keep you entertained and engaged.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Interactive Elements:</i></strong> Interact with interesting objects and characters within the game. Explore and enjoy, as anything can happen in the Toilet World!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb5Skibidi, dom-dom-dom, yes-yes\ud83c\udfb5</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298660/extras/d8fea003926231c3f49745e1623e449f.poster.avif?t=1736218150\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298660/extras/d8fea003926231c3f49745e1623e449f.webm?t=1736218150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298660/extras/d8fea003926231c3f49745e1623e449f.mp4?t=1736218150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us and dive into the wacky and wild Toilet World! Ready to flush away boredom? This game is your answer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is created by <strong>@Colorfulgame</strong> with YAHAHA Horror Game Kit and YAHAHA assists the creator with packaging and publishing the game based on their request. Yahaha Horror Gamekit is tailored for imaginative creators and players who adore horror games, all without the need for any programming expertise.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298660/extras/07d4759cf28f755ca4f93d5a1ea853e0.avif?t=1736218150\" width=720 height=216 /></span></p>",
